    /// boxed ones -- a NaN, an infinity, a magnitude outside the
    /// SmallFloat64 range -- as much as the immediate ones.
    ///
    /// @param other any object; anything that is no number is unequal.
    /// @answers whether `other` is a number of the same exact value, a
    /// Boolean.
    /// @see `Number>>=`.
    public = other = (
      ^vmMirror float: self equals: other ifFail: [^super = other].
    )

    /// Hashes the receiver by its exact value, so that the hash agrees
    /// with `=` whatever the classes: an integral Float's is the integer
